<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύτλ-ον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything that can be poured, liquid, fluid</i>; esp.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύτλα,</span>
			<i>water for washing, the bath,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1099
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				9.7
			</span></i>; but also, <i>libations</i> to the dead, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
				1927.161
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>), <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1075
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.927
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a mixture of water and oil,</i> elsewh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρέλαιον,</span> rubbed in after bathing, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυτλάζηται.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>running water, stream,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				701
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
